 "notes": "Merged: Flash glucose monitor (Libre 14-Day kept as a flash type/model) and Glucose sensor (now 'replacement sensor' type) into Continuous glucose monitor; Glucose test strip into Blood glucose meter (strips and lancets as consumable types; the single CONTOUR NEXT strip SKU dropped). Added Insulin pump and Insulin pen (new kinds, sourced to Wikipedia; models from ADA Consumer Guide pump/smart-pen/CGM/meter lists, Diabetes UK smart-pen page, Lilly KwikPen release, Ypsomed mylife Loop guide, MiniMed 780G article). Models kept to market-covering makers. Left out: Tempo Pen (Lilly; ADA lists it as discontinued 2026), disposable FlexPen/SoloStar and reusable HumaPen/ClikSTAR (not retrieved this session), Abbott Lingo (not verified). No brand entries for Novo Nordisk, Senseonics, Beta Bionics, Sequel, i-Sens, Dario Health, Medtrum or PTS Diagnostics (no brand page retrieved). The wiki/wikidata helper tools failed (lock error), so pages were retrieved with web_fetch. No craft traditions apply to this shelf.",
